  "description": "Fuselage: American's silver. Cheatlines: A teal cheatline low on the side, curving down to the bottom of the nose, with a thin gray pinstripe above it, running aft into a teal tail section. Tail: Silver upper fin; teal lower fin whose top edge is a ridge of three white snow-capped peaks rising aft. Engines: Silver. Winglets: Silver. Titles: Standard 'American' and flight symbol forward. Artwork: Mountain peaks on the fin. Colors hex: matched from photos.",
